     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Counting a complete action",
     "texto": [
      "**遍** counts an action done from start to finish: **读一遍** = read it once all the way through. **回** counts an occasion: **去过两回** = have been twice.",
      "Don't confuse **遍**, which stresses completing the whole route or text, with **次**, which counts how many times an action happens."
     ],
